            "field": "content",
            "sha256": "a1c13c31013e553eb8f12cabcf0dc84aa2818054864d61764eff4beac96b080e",
            "start": 394,
            "end": 522,
            "quote": "PyTorch 开启 `torch.autograd.set_detect_anomaly(True)`（或 `with torch.autograd.detect_anomaly():`），能在反向传播产生 NaN 时抛出并指出是哪个算子/前向节点引入。",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-27",
            "event_id": "client-note-00005",
            "field": "content",
            "sha256": "a1c13c31013e553eb8f12cabcf0dc84aa2818054864d61764eff4beac96b080e",
            "start": 761,
            "end": 835,
            "quote": "学习率过大是 loss 发散最常见原因：降低 lr（如 ÷10）、使用 warmup（线性 warmup 若干 step）、或 lr finder。",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-28",
            "event_id": "client-note-00005",
            "field": "content",
            "sha256": "a1c13c31013e553eb8f12cabcf0dc84aa2818054864d61764eff4beac96b080e",
            "start": 983,
            "end": 1035,
            "quote": "若 loss scale 不合适或模型中出现 fp16 溢出（>65504），会产生 inf → NaN",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-29",
            "event_id": "client-note-00005",
            "field": "content",
            "sha256": "a1c13c31013e553eb8f12cabcf0dc84aa2818054864d61764eff4beac96b080e",
            "start": 1287,
            "end": 1374,
            "quote": "输入含 NaN/Inf：`assert torch.isfinite(x).all()` 检查数据管道；脏标签（如分类 target 为负数或 ≥ num_classes）。",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-30",
            "event_id": "WebFetch_5_a8f08d60.result",
            "field": "response",
            "sha256": "b84fb1c50ca72b04898bbf3d3c135c7250d02257efcc6a98dcae708bcf065cf8",
            "start": 10099,
            "end": 10212,
            "quote": "cannot operate in the fp16 numerical range of max 65504 and will cause gradients to overflow instead of underflow",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-31",
            "event_id": "WebFetch_5_a8f08d60.result",
            "field": "response",
            "sha256": "b84fb1c50ca72b04898bbf3d3c135c7250d02257efcc6a98dcae708bcf065cf8",
            "start": 784,
            "end": 926,
            "quote": "`torch.cuda.amp.GradScaler(args...)` and `torch.cpu.amp.GradScaler(args...)` is deprecated. Please use `torch.amp.GradScaler(\"cuda\", args...)`",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
